    /* ready = the glint alone now (the chips are gone), so it reads a touch
       stronger. ⚠️ the glow is a SEPARATE child animating OPACITY only — the
       old version animated `filter` between drop-shadows and an 8px blur,
       which re-ran a multi-pass GPU blur every frame per ready plant, forever
       (the never-animate-filter doctrine, broken here and now repaid). */
    .pk-plant.is-ready::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -34%; pointer-events: none;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 225, 53, 0.6) 0%, rgba(255, 225, 53, 0) 68%);
