       bird moves RIGHT. Stepping rule for 4 frames: 100% × 4/3 = 133.334%. */
    .pk-gbird {
      position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 1.16%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, -100%); pointer-events: none;
      image-rendering: pixelated; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 400% 400%;
      filter: drop-shadow(1px 1px 0 rgba(20, 40, 18, 0.3));
