    /* 🎮 THE DAY BADGES. Was a 2-column grid of full-width rows, each with
       a long label and a lake of empty space beside it on desktop (Trym: "way
       more pretty... bigger pills with icon and stat"). Now they size to their
       own content and wrap, so the card is as big as its numbers and no bigger.
